    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Requires attunement by a Bard. Play it to cast one of its spells with your spellcasting ability and save DC; each spell once per dawn: Fly, Invisibility, Levitate, Protection from Evil and Good, Entangle, Faerie Fire, Shillelagh, Speak with Animals. A creature that plays it without being attuned makes a DC 15 WIS save or takes 2d4 Psychic damage (module), and the spell isn't cast.</p>",
